{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42714","headline":"齿落词 · 王周","name":"齿落词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"己卯至庚辰，仲夏晦之暮。\n吾齿右排上，一齿脱而去。\n呼吸缺吾防，咀嚼欠吾助。\n年龠惜不返，日驭走爲蠹。\n唇亡得无寒，舌在从何诉。\n辅车宜长依，发肤可增惧。\n不须考前古，聊且爲近喻。\n有如云中雨，雨散绝回顾。\n有如枝上叶，叶脱难再附。\n白发非独愁，红颜岂私驻。\n何必郁九回，何必牵百虑。\n开尊复开怀，引笔作长句。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王周","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42714.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42714","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}